**Experiment 32: lm_head Muon retry with conservative LR**

- Moved lm_head (32768x512, 16.8M params) from AdamW (lr=0.0049) to a dedicated Muon group (base lr=0.005, effective lr=0.04 after rectangular scaling)
- Exp23 had the same idea but crashed (likely infra — 4+ consecutive infra crashes around that time) and used lr=0.04 (effective 0.32 = way too aggressive)
- NS orthogonalization pushes 32768 output vectors toward isometry in 512-dim space — instant preconditioning vs AdamW's slow second-moment warmup
